  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design &amp; build of an aquaculture park in Mwena, Kalagala District, Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An aquaculture park (aquaculture operations facility) is to be designed and constructed at Mwena in Kalangala District on Lake Victoria. It will house various operational components, including buildings, associated cages for fish growing, a hatchery for hatching and rearing fish fingerlings, ice making and storage equipment, maintenance and storage facilities and areas, accommodation block, feed storage and others. At the project site some previous infrastructure are in place that will be rehabilitated including buildings, ice making machine and a wharf. Other infrastructure that will be rehabilitated include general site access requirements, road widening, power and drainage, pump houses, fencing and access security aspects.</narrative>
  </description>
